tellraw @s {"text":"Stack in hand: use to draw top; sneak-use to shuffle, or put the offhand card on top. Card in hand: use to place face-down. Sneak-use avoids opening a workstation. On a placed card: use to turn over; sneak-use to rotate; hit to retrieve (hit while holding a stack to put back on top, sneak-hit to gather nearby cards). /trigger tarot.action set 1 draw, 2 shuffle, 3 put on top, 4 place, 5 deal face-down. Keep the offhand clear except for returns. Mounted or blocked clicks use the trigger controls reliably. Guides: book + amethyst for Steve's; add a feather for Alex's.","color":"gray"}
